{"n": 1283, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1283.webp", "text": "3071 ofe\n\nOpen up holes {a).\n\nDrill 5 mm (0.197\") diameter holes (b)\n\nDia. = 10.5 mm (0.413\")\n\nA= 52 mm (2.047\").\n\nDeburr and coat edges of holes with zinc dust\npaint.\n\nMark location of hole for electric wires, center\npunch and drill hole (initial and final drilling).\nA = 24 mm (0.945)\n\nB = 20 mm (0.787\")\n\nC = 36 mm (1.417\") dia.\n\nDeburr and coat edges of hole with zinc dust\n\npaint.\nRemove burrs from trunk.\n\nMount trailer hitch.\n\nFour each M 10 hexagon nuts.\n\nFour each 10.5 x 30 x 3 washers\n\nTighten nuts and bolts to torque of 43 to 48\nNm (31 to 35 ft. Ibs.).\n\nBolt final muffler.\n\nInstall reinforcement plate (2).\n\nTighten nuts to torque of 43 to 48 Nm (31 to\n35 ft. Ibs.) and install caps (1).\n\nFour each M 10 nuts\n\n2 reinforcement plates\n\n4 caps\n\nNote:\n\nSea! hole (a).\n\nDisconnect battery ground lead.\nRemove BMW emblem.\n\nMark position of steering wheel to steering\nspindle.\n\nUnscrew nut (1) and remove with washer (2).\nImportant!\n\nSteering wheel can only be pulled off after\nunlocking the steering lock.\n\nInstallation:\n\nReplace self-locking nut.\n\nNut tightening torque: 73 to 85 Nm (53 to 61\nft. Ibs,).\n\nRemove instrument panel trim.\n\nRemove steering column casing lower section.", "words": [["3071", 0.2026, 0.5119, 0.2259, 0.5199], ["ofe", 0.2305, 0.5073, 0.2472, 0.5192], ["Open", 0.2624, 0.0597, 0.2872, 0.0729], ["up", 0.2908, 0.063, 0.3029, 0.0729], ["holes", 0.3065, 0.0603, 0.3308, 0.0703], ["{a).", 0.3349, 0.0597, 0.3495, 0.0716], ["Drill", 0.2619, 0.0756, 0.2827, 0.0862], ["5", 0.2867, 0.0756, 0.2918, 0.0862], ["mm", 0.2958, 0.0782, 0.3141, 0.0855], ["(0.197\")", 0.3181, 0.0749, 0.3587, 0.0862], ["diameter", 0.3627, 0.0756, 0.4037, 0.0855], ["holes", 0.4073, 0.0756, 0.4316, 0.0855], ["(b)", 0.4352, 0.0749, 0.4478, 0.0862], ["Dia.", 0.2624, 0.0915, 0.2806, 0.1021], ["=", 0.2847, 0.0948, 0.2898, 0.0995], ["10.5", 0.2948, 0.0915, 0.31